  "details": "As an addition or compromise for the Local-Only/Remote-Only Grab Settings canny, I would like to be able to tell if a remote user grabbed my PhysBone.\nCurrently, my knife on my avatar is grabbable by all players, which will force the knife into one of my hands even if the knife was grabbed by a remote user. I think it would be fun to allow remote users to steal my knife, but I can't tell the difference between a remote and local grab.\n\nLocal-Only/Remote-Only Grab Settings canny for reference:\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1181-local-onlyremote-only-grabbing-per-physbone\n\nnakos",
